":"Yuuji's energetic younger sister who is a carrier, carrying Little Mermaid's spirit inside her. Originally not a resident on this island, Seiko is soon sent to her older brother as the story progresses, and allows the awakening of her own “Princess Syndrome”. Seiko is an extreme brocon who is really attached to her brother, and also considered the moodmaker of the group. Her trigger emotion is \"jealousy\", which allows her to \"erase\" things, especially clothes."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13059"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園一年生。祐二の一つ年下の妹である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は明るく快活で気が強いタイプ。ムードメーカー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スタイル抜群高身長で、物凄い美貌を持つが――いかんせん残念。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物怖じしない性格で、自らがもて囃されるのを好む。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"表には出さないが極度の“ブラコン”であり、主人公を追い掛けて学園にやって来る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績はあまりよろしくないが、運動神経は良い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アニメとゲームなどオタク的な趣味を持つ彼女の心に住む＜お姫さま＞は＜人魚姫＞。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自身の「嫉妬心」が刺激されることによって発現する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ａ級の＜お姫さま病【プリンセスシンドローム】＞で、＜望奏【メルヘン】＞、＜海之藻屑【チェンジソープ】＞を使い、質量の低い生物以外のものを泡に変え、消し去ってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"たとえば、誰かが着ている洋服など。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"変貌時、やたらと攻撃的な性格になり、特に主人公への独占欲を示すようになる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1820","sourceWorkId":"19081","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園一年生。祐二の一つ年下の妹である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は明るく快活で気が強いタイプ。ムードメーカー。 スタイル抜群・高身長で、もの凄い美貌を持つが―― いかんせん残念。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物怖じしない性格で、自らがもて囃されるのを好む。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"表には出さないが極度の “ブラコン” であり、主人公を追い掛けて学園にやって来る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績はあまりよろしくないが、運動神経は良い。 アニメとゲームなどオタク的な趣味を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女の心に住む “お姫さま” は “人魚姫”。 自身の “嫉妬心” が刺激されることによって発現する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A級の “お姫さま病（プリンセスシンドローム）” で、“望奏（メルヘン）” 海之藻屑（チェンジソープ） を使い、質量の低い生物以外の物を泡に変え、消し去ってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"たとえば、誰かが着ている洋服など。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"変貌時、やたらと攻撃的な性格になり、特に主人公への独占欲を示すようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「おにーちゃん、星子に逢えなくて寂しいに決まってます！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21805"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"94 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1820","sourceWorkId":"19081","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"d","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1820","sourceWorkId":"19081","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"179 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1820","sourceWorkId":"19081","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"95 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1820","sourceWorkId":"19081","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"68 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1820","sourceWorkId":"19081","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c8/c814ea917603b630c9a93383512144e8d90017a189fbb96cf214480a695fe259.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bb31d21dd6f57fae6e4956517e3a1be808b2112edbc3b28e7d8dcd18e2f70170.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"種﨑敦美","creatorId":"vndb:s196","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s196","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s196","name":"種﨑 敦美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:73743:21805:7575:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c13060","characterName":"恋ノ河 リイナ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"21806","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"73743"}],"egsCharacterIds":["1821"],"vndbCharacterId":"c13060"},"originalCharacterName":"恋ノ河 リイナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"78"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"A"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"79"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Key Emotion: Loneliness"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rank: S-rank"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yuuji's classmate and his class president who is a carrier, carrying Cinderella's spirit inside her. Rina is also the leader of a group called “Calibur” (Spelled as “Disciplinary Comitee”) in-game whose job is to patrol the island and stop any “Princess Awakenings”. Rina is soft-spoken and very stubborn. She enjoys multitasking by doing many things at the same time, like reading a book while doing her business in the bathroom. Her favorite food is pork ramen."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her trigger emotion is \"loneliness\", and being a \"S-ranked princess\" like Izumi, Rina's power is as dangerous: she has the power to make anything happen for certain amount of time. Despite this, she has very good control over her powers, and is often resisting awakening."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Rina's dream is to eradicate all adults out of the world because of her past, where her parents would often leave her alone to the point where she considered to be abandoned by them. Out of all the routes, Rina's is the only one that includes the main girl completely losing their princess syndrome."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13060"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園二年生。祐二とは同じクラス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"＜お姫さま病【プリンセスシンドローム】＞にかかった少女達を鎮静させるための学園の機関、＜風紀委員【キャリバー】＞の＜委員長【マスター】＞を務めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"＜リンゴ銃＞と呼ばれる不思議な水鉄砲を武器に、＜お姫さま＞化して暴れる少女たちの鎮静に当たる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"寡黙に見えるが、案外に饒舌かつ毒舌。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"というよりは、見たまま感じたままのことすべてを口にしてしまうらしく、遠慮がない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人曰わく、感情というものをよくわかっていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好物はとんこつらーめん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『日常最速理論』という理論を提唱しており、その理論に基づいて彼女は行動している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"曰わく、歯磨きとトイレは同時に済ませば時間が節約出来る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"曰わく、湯船に浸かる時は必ず英単語の暗記カードを持ち込む、など。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"マルチタスクこそが生き甲斐で、自己鍛錬も欠かさない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恥じらいがないため、天然でエロについて興味を示す。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1821","sourceWorkId":"19081","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園二年生。祐二とは同じクラス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“お姫さま病（プリンセスシンドローム）” にかかった少女たちを鎮静させるための学園の機関 “風紀委員（キャリバー）” の “委員長（マスター）” を務めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“リンゴ銃” と呼ばれる不思議な水鉄砲を武器に、“お姫さま”化して暴れる少女たちの鎮静に当たる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"寡黙に見えるが、案外に饒舌かつ毒舌。 というよりは、見たまま感じたままのことすべてを口にしてしまうらしく、遠慮がない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人曰わく、感情というものをよく分かっていない。 好物はとんこつらーめん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“日常最速理論” という理論を提唱しており、その理論に基づいて彼女は行動している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"曰わく、歯磨きとトイレは同時に済ませば時間が節約出来る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"曰わく、湯船に浸かる時は必ず英単語の暗記カードを持ち込む、など。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"マルチタスクこそが生き甲斐で、自己鍛錬も欠かさない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恥じらいがないため、天然でエロについて興味を示す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「……常日頃、効率的に生きることを心掛けてるの」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21806"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"78 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1821","sourceWorkId":"19081","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"a","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1821","sourceWorkId":"19081","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"158 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1821","sourceWorkId":"19081","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"79 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1821","sourceWorkId":"19081","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"60 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1821","sourceWorkId":"19081","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflict